Source: audiolite-dlkm
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Renfei Qian <renfqian@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               linux-headers-6.6.110
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://git.codelinaro.org
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: audiolite-dlkm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         kmod
Description: Audiolite kernel module (pre-built)
 This is a test driver to show example communication between GVM / PVM / DSPs.
 It provides the ipcc_shmem_test_module kernel module for audiolite support.
 .
 This package contains the pre-built .ko for kernel 6.6.110, installed to
 /lib/modules/6.6.110/updates/dkms/. No DKMS or kernel headers required
 on the target machine.

Package: audiolite-dlkm-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         audiolite-dlkm (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Audiolite kernel module - development headers
 This package provides the C header file (ipcc_shmem_module.h)
 for userspace programs that interface with the ipcc_shmem_test_module
 kernel module.
 .
 Install this package when building software that uses the audiolite
 IPCC shared-memory kernel interface.
